  Configure Status Line
  Select items: [ ] off, [x] on, [b] brief (when available).

  Type to search

› [x] Use theme colors      Apply colors from the active /theme
  ───────────────────────
  [b] context-remaining     Percentage of context window remaining (omitted when unknown)
  [b] context-used          Percentage of context window used (omitted when unknown)
  [b] five-hour-limit       Remaining usage on the 5-hour usage limit (omitted when unavailable)
  [b] weekly-limit          Remaining usage on the weekly usage limit (omitted when unavailable)
  [ ] model                 Current model name
  [ ] model-with-reasoning  Current model name with reasoning level
↓
  ctx < 100% · ctx > 0% · 5h < 65% · 7d < 50%
  space toggle · ←/→ reorder · enter save · esc cancel
